config AUDIO_CODEC_ES8388
	bool "Everest ES8388 codec driver"
	default y
	select I2C
	depends on DT_HAS_EVEREST_ES8388_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the driver for the Everest ES8388 stereo audio codec, whose
	  control interface is I2C and whose data interface is I2S.

	  The register model follows the ES8328, which is also what Linux drives
	  for the "everest,es8388" compatible. Playback (DAC) and capture (ADC)
	  are implemented with I2S/left/right justified formats, 16/18/20/24/32
	  bit words, the sample rates of a 12.288 MHz and an 11.2896 MHz system
	  clock, master or target role, and output/input volume and mute.
